    "body": "Not sure exactly how parameter matching is supposed to work. Let's say a UA supports `image/foo` with the `bar` parameter set to any value. The MIME type record you get from parsing `image/foo;bar=baz` is not literally going to be in the set. (Unless the set is infinite in size; I guess in theory that's allowed.)\r\n\r\nIt feels like the \"supported image MIME types\" structure needs to get more complicated, to handle this sort of case?",
