    "body": "I think that would be good, but do we have a processing model for images being disabled? https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#when-to-obtain-images suggests that images are either obtained immediately or on demand, but doesn't allow for them to be completely disabled. The specification model at least suggests to me that the supported image MIME type situation wouldn't change.",
